.TH TAGVIEW 1 "2026-11-02" "tagplay 0.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tagview \- query-driven photo metadata browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tagview
.RI [ options ]
.IR PHOTO_DIR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tagview
is the photo face of the tagplay browser core: it scans directories
of images, reads EXIF, IPTC, XMP and PNG metadata, and offers the
same incremental query language as
.BR tagplay (1)
over fields such as
.BR tag ", " camera ", " city ", " year ", " width ", " height ", "
.BR mpix " and " format .
.PP
Interactively: type to filter (e.g.\&
.IR "tag=alps & year>2000 & camera~nikon" ),
.B Tab
moves to the list,
.B Enter
or
.B a
shows the image (via
.BR chafa (1)
when available),
.B t
inspects every tag on the cursored photo.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-q " EXPR"
One-shot query: print matching paths and exit.
.TP
.BI \-s " FIELDS"
Sort spec for
.B \-q
(e.g.\&
.BR date,\-width ).
.TP
.B \-t
With
.BR \-q :
print title/camera/date/dimensions columns.
.TP
.BI \-C " PATH"
Cache file (default
.IR ~/.cache/tagview/cache.bin ).
.TP
.B \-n
No cache.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/tagview/cache.bin
Metadata cache.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tagplay (1),
.BR tagplay-gui (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mico Mrkaic.  GPL-3.0-or-later.
